  <h1>About The Digital Income Edit™</h1>
  <p class="lede">I didn't build an audience and then work out what to sell them. I did it backwards — and that's the entire point.</p>

  <p>The Digital Income Edit™ exists because I think the order everyone teaches is wrong. Grow first, post daily, show your face, and someday a business will materialise. So women perform for an algorithm for two years and have nothing underneath them when the reach dies.</p>

  <p>I built the business first. The offer, the funnel, the brand system, the automation — with AI doing the heavy construction and me making the decisions. No face on camera. No audience when I started.</p>

  <p>The site you're reading, the classroom behind it, the emails that land in your inbox if you join — all of it came off one method: <em>Build Your Business Backwards. Scale It Forward.™</em></p>

  <p>Faceless doesn't mean nobody's there. It means your real face is never the thing being sold. The brand's face does that work, so yours doesn't have to.</p>

  <p>I'm not going to show you screenshots. I'm going to show you the machine. It's all here — walk through it.</p>

